istorial de Modo IA. <a class="tOOqxf" role="link" target="_blank" href="https://support.google.com/websearch/answer/16517651" data-sb="/url?sa=i&amp;source=web&amp;rct=j&amp;url=https://support.google.com/websearch/answer/16517651&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjKh8iH-Y2YAxXtjCsGHVKXE8gQ2ZYQegYIAAgAECA&amp;opi=89978449&amp;cd&amp;psig=AOvVaw0h6D2MNRxJKlCZEqifPBCa&amp;ust=1794968549712000">Más información</a></div><div class="bWRGjd"><div data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;aK2PZc_2h|npT2md" jscontroller="mQ0Qzd#AY6EV" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="aK2PZc_2h" data-wiz-uids="aK2PZc_2i,aK2PZc_2j,aK2PZc_2k" data-ctx-provider="[[[&quot;b9Q7he&quot;,&quot;[1]&quot;]]]" data-sfc-inited="2"><div role="dialog" tabindex="-1" jsuid="aK2PZc_2i" class="FAd6bc b7N2Ud" aria-labelledby="aim-modal-title-Zbr7aorBKe2ZruEP0q7OwAw_0l3lph_3" aria-describedby="aim-modal-body-Zbr7aorBKe2ZruEP0q7OwAw_0l3lph_3"><div class="YEPqWe"><div class="b7E6Zd" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="EQxvpc m4l7Cf" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M280-120q-33,0-56.5-23.5T200-200V-720H160v-80H360v-40H600v40H800v80H760v520q0,33-23.5,56.5T680-120H280ZM680-720H280v520H680V-720ZM360-280h80V-640H360v360Zm160,0h80V-640H520v360ZM280-720v520V-720Z"></path></svg></div><p id="aim-modal-title-Zbr7aorBKe2ZruEP0q7OwAw_0l3lph_3" aria-level="1" role="heading" class="aGNwSd">¿Quieres borrar todos los vínculos públicos?</p><div id="aim-modal-body-Zbr7aorBKe2ZruEP0q7OwAw_0l3lph_3" class="bup7Bd">Si borras todos tus vínculos compartidos, ya nadie podrá ver el contenido que incluían. Si borras un vínculo, seguirás teniendo acceso a la conversación en tu historial del Modo IA.<div class="iouOxb"><a class="tOOqxf" role="link" target="_blank" href="https://support.google.com/websearch/answer/16517651" data-sb="/url?sa=i&amp;source=web&amp;rct=j&amp;url=https://support.google.com/websearch/answer/16517651&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjKh8iH-Y2YAxXtjCsGHVKXE8gQxZ0QegYIAAgAECE&amp;opi=89978449&a